{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_169","slug":"fr2023-169-nouveau-depart","title":{"native":"Nouveau Départ","english":"New Beginnings"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-09-27","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Philippe Lefebvre","slug":"philippe-lefebvre","name":"Philippe Lefebvre","birthYear":1968,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/57/23/268089/format_page/new-beginnings.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zBbfsZVnkew"},"synopsis":{"native":"Amoureux de Diane comme au premier jour, Alain traverse la cinquantaine sans crise. Même le départ des enfants, il l’a bien vécu. Diane moins.… Cette période, elle l’entame avec la sensation qu’elle pourrait mourir d’ennui ou d’angoisse. Pour Alain, qui voit pour la première fois son couple vaciller, il est temps de se poser les questions essentielles, et de prendre un risque majeur après 30 ans de vie commune : quitter Diane pour réveiller la flamme et l’envie de se retrouver. Nouveau Départ, c’est l’histoire d’une histoire d’amour à quitte ou double.","english":"Alain's love for Diane remains as strong as the day they first met, Alain has made it through his fifties without a crisis. On the other hand, Diane enters this period feeling that she could die of boredom or anxiety. For Alain, it's time to take a major risk after 30 years together: leaving Diane to rekindle the flame and the desire to find each other again!"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2023_169_01","film":"FR2023_169","person":{"id":"Franck Dubosc","slug":"franck-dubosc","name":"Franck Dubosc","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle